<head>
    <title>GeoStudio Product Improvement Program</title>
    <style>
body {
	font: message-box; 
	color: rgb(35%,35%,35%);
	background-color: white;
	margin: 1em;
	padding: 0 0 0 0;
	overflow: hidden;	/* no scroll bars */
	
	scrollbar-base-color: rgb(213,239,252);
	scrollbar-track-color: rgb(85%,85%,85%);
	scrollbar-darkshadow-color: rgb(213,239,252);
	scrollbar-shadow-color: rgb(213,239,252);
	scrollbar-arrow-color: rgb(60%,60%,60%);
}

p { 
	line-height: 140%;
	margin-bottom: .8em;
	margin-top: 0pt;
}
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div id="divBody">
        <h2>Help us improve GeoStudio</h2>
        <p>
            By joining the Product Improvement Program, you will be directly contributing to
            the design and development of future GeoStudio releases.
        </p>
        <p>
            With this option checked, GeoStudio will automatically connect to a GEOSLOPE server
            to send anonymous information about how you use GeoStudio.
        </p>

        <ul style="display:inline-block; margin-top:0px">
            <li>No personal or confidential information is collected.</li>
            <li>Data is sent in the background without interrupting your workflow.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            You may opt out at any time by choosing Edit Options in the GeoStudio menu.
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
